      "note": "Fifteen complete exact certificates at ea1a2f23678a13bd1d252f9f4c95ca5dd2ffd2b7, unchanged since 346c6ed, from the display-regularized record lists of search/regularize, made for this project's poster with orientations fitted to its known-best witnesses: each the source's best packing at its count solved to its exact side, regularized for display at that side and scaled by 1 + 1e-20. The packings are Xu's, Deleeuw's, Mishapolk's and Chaoweeraprasit's. MIT-licensed certificates and JSON retained; Claude assistance disclosed. The source claims no record; no KKT, same-packing, local or global optimality is admitted."
